{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50968","headline":"题三学院经楼 · 段义宗","name":"题三学院经楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹫岭鷄园不可俦，叨陪龙象喜登游。\n玉排复道珊瑚殿，金错危栏翡翠楼。\n尚欲归心求四谛，敢辞旋绕满三周。\n羲和鞭挞金乌疾，欲网无由肯驻留？\n（同前《监诫录》卷六。\n《全唐诗》佚句卷只存三、四句。\n此诗第四句「危栏」，《全唐诗》作「危椆」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段义宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}